Cell["\<\
The ball quotients on the square tiling under three measures; the sphere \
probe, on the full shell count, is the same in all three.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"23de91d1-f43d-4599-9970-148f1564fbc5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
